              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ mbee wa mũĩkĩĩo ũtanoka, twekalĩte twovetwe ungu wa mĩao, tũvingĩĩtwe kũvika ũla mũĩkĩĩo ũkonanw’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.3.23",
